					"sendto" : "bach.help.filtertags",
					"text" : "The #catchplay attributes defines the way the playhead will force a change in the displayed portion of score during playback.\nMode 0 (Don't) just doesn't force any change in the domain.\nMode 1 (ChangePage), which is the default, changes the domain when the playback reaches the end of the line, as if every domain was a different page of a book\nMode 2 (FixedPlayHead) constantly updates the domain so that the playhead remains in a fixed relative position inside the window. This relative position is defined by the \"playheadfixedpos\" attribute.\nImportantly, this isn't true for the very beginning: the bar will always starts from the leftmost point, and will get fixed only once it reaches the ",
